        "answer": {
          "short": "$S$ only: $18-2x$; $I$ only: $7$; $O$ only: $y$; $S\\cap I$ only: $2x$; $S\\cap O$ only: $2$; $I\\cap O$ only: $x$; all three: $2$; outside: $3$.",
          "worked": "Using the definitions of $x$ and $y$ in part b, the interstate-and-own-state-only region is $2x$. Since 22 people travelled within their own state,\n$$\\begin{align*}\nS\\text{ only}&=22-2x-2-2\\\\\n&=18-2x.\n\\end{align*}$$\nPlace the remaining given counts and the expressions $x$ and $y$ in their corresponding regions.",
